<title>UK: CNA sets 1.4 billion French franc domestic bond.</title>
<headline>CNA sets 1.4 billion French franc domestic bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque National de Paris and Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAISSE NATIONALE DES AUTOROUTES</p>
<p> AMT    1.4 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.85	MATURITY    24.MAR.13</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.460   PAY DATE    24.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.3	 REOFFER    99.58     SPREAD	+13 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
